  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "In the year 3037, the most competitive sport in the known universe is Ballblazer. For the first time ever, humans from the planet Earth have won the right to compete in the final round of the Ballblazer Championship, to fight for Earth's honor and the title Masterblazer!\n\nBallblazer is a 3D futuristic soccer-like game, where the player (inside a Rotofoil) is set on a one-on-one 1,155 square playing field (the Grid). The objective of the player to kick a floating ball (Plasmorb) inside the opponent's goal (Goalbeams). A player may compete against a human or computer opponent.\n\nThe Rotofoil is equipped with a multi-purpose forcefield. This forcefield when in short distance of the Plasmorb will act as a pull field, automatically pulling the Plasmorb towards to player. When a player in possession of the Plasmorb shoots, the forcefield will act as push field and launches the ball. When the match starts, the player must move down field and attempt to gain possession of the Plasmorb using the joystick and blast the Plasmorb to an intended direction. \n\nThe player should also be aware that the Goldbeams move slightly every second and the distance between them will shrink. The highest scoring goals are goals made when Goldbeams have disappeared across the horizon (Over The Horizon/OTH shots). A player may also attempt to steal possession of a Plasmorb by rushing beside the opponent and blast the Plasmorb away. The game ends when time runs out or a player wins 10 consecutive goals. If the game ends in a draw, over-time will apply and the first player to score will win the game.\n\nScoring\n\nClose-in goals - 1 point\nGoals near Goldbeams - 2 points\nOTH shots - 3 points\nPlayers may steal points from each other by making goals. \nThe total combined score of both players cannot accede more than 10 points.\nA player winning 10 consecutive points automatically wins the game."
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "En l'an 3037, le sport le plus compétitif de l'univers connu est Ballblazer. Ballblazer est un jeu de football futuriste en 3D, dans lequel le joueur (à l'intérieur d'un Rotofoil) est installé sur un terrain de jeu individuel de 1155 carrés (la grille) présenté dans une perspective à la première personne. L'objectif du joueur est de lancer un ballon flottant (Plasmorb) à l'intérieur du but de l'adversaire (Goalbeams).  Un joueur peut rivaliser avec un adversaire humain ou l'ordinateur. Le jeu permet de joueur contre l'ordinateur ou contre un autre humain."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Im Jahr 3037 ist die wettbewerbsfähigste Sportart im bekannten Universum Ballblazer. Ballblazer ist ein futuristisches 3D-Fußballspiel, bei dem der Spieler (in einem Rotofoil) auf einem individuellen Spielfeld von 1155 Quadraten (dem Raster) sitzt, das in einer First-Person-Perspektive dargestellt wird. Das Ziel des Spielers ist es, einen schwebenden Ball (Plasmorb) in das Tor des Gegners (Goalbeams) zu werfen.  Ein Spieler kann gegen einen menschlichen Gegner oder den Computer antreten. Das Spiel ermöglicht es, gegen den Computer oder gegen einen anderen Menschen zu spielen."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "En el año 3037, Ballblazer es el deporte más competitivo del universo, y los humanos han llegado a la final del Campeonato para luchar por el título de Masterblazer. Este juego de fútbol futurista en 3D se desarrolla en un campo de 1,155 metros cuadrados, donde los jugadores, dentro de Rotofoils, deben lanzar la Plasmorb (una bola flotante) dentro de los Goalbeams del oponente.\r\n\r\nEl Rotofoil tiene un campo de fuerza que atrae o lanza la Plasmorb según la distancia. Los jugadores deben moverse rápidamente, capturar la Plasmorb, esquivar al rival y disparar a los Goalbeams, que se mueven y se estrechan con el tiempo. Los goles más valiosos son los de &quot;Over The Horizon&quot; (OTH), cuando los Goalbeams desaparecen en el horizonte.\r\n\r\nEl partido termina cuando un jugador anota 10 goles consecutivos o se agota el tiempo. Si hay empate, el tiempo extra decidirá al ganador con el primer gol anotado. Ballblazer puede jugarse contra la computadora o en modo de dos jugadores."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "Nell'anno 3037, lo sport più competitivo dell'universo conosciuto è Ballblazer. Ballblazer è un gioco di calcio futuristico in 3D, in cui il giocatore (all'interno di un Rotofoil) si trova su un campo di gioco individuale di 1155 caselle (la griglia) presentato in una prospettiva in prima persona. L'obiettivo del giocatore è lanciare una palla fluttuante (Plasmorb) nella porta avversaria (Goalbeams).  Il giocatore può competere con un avversario umano o con il computer. Il gioco può essere giocato contro il computer o contro un altro umano."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "No ano 3037, o desporto mais competitivo do universo conhecido é o Ballblazer. O Ballblazer é um jogo de futebol 3D futurista, no qual o jogador (dentro de um Rotofoil) é colocado num campo de jogo individual de 1155 quadrados (a grelha) apresentado numa perspectiva de primeira pessoa. O objectivo do jogador é lançar uma bola flutuante (Plasmorb) para a baliza do adversário (Goalbeams).  Um jogador pode competir com um adversário humano ou com o computador. O jogo pode ser jogado contra o computador ou contra outro humano."
    }
  ],
